# What the images are built without. The install's own checks import ontology/service on the host and
# leave __pycache__ beside it; COPY carried that in, so the second ./install.sh rebuilt the ontology and
# recreated its container (quickstart QS-3, 2026-11-02). check/env-check.py holds the first four.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
data
.git
# Nothing below is copied into an image either; leaving it out keeps the context small and the build's
# cache from depending on it.
data-*
.env
.claude
pylib
eval
bench
